@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api/user

### happy path
GET {{base_url}}/1 HTTP/1.1

### unhappy path :user not found 
GET {{base_url}}/99 HTTP/1.1

### unhappy path: User with id < 0
GET {{base_url}}/-1 HTTP/1.1

### Create a new user
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Fredie wink",
  "password_hash": "thispassword",
  "is_organization": "TRUE"
}